From dfb668bba19b1b058b8115d6898c7f91862808f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Gigena <mail@andrewgigena.dev>
Date: Thu, 31 Jul 2025 11:11:35 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 55/77] Input: touchscreen: stm,fts driver

Port the stm,fts touchscreen driver from Android kernel v4.14 to mainline
kernel v6.16. The driver supports the touchscreen on Google Pixel 4 and 4 XL
devices.

The driver has been tested on Pixel 4 and basic touch functionality is confirmed to be working.

Original source: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/msm-modules/fts_touch/+log/android-msm-coral-4.14-android13
Patched source: https://github.com/andrewgigena/fts_touch/tree/v5.2.16.8-kernel_v6.16

Signed-off-by: Andrew Gigena <mail@andrewgigena.dev>
